OL,3,GNEWSAArmy to keep learning after
OL,4,Aofficer killed in training - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Army will "keep learning" from
OL,7,F"mistakes" that led to the death of an
OL,8,Fofficer when a Warrior armoured vehicle
OL,9,Fwith a faulty alarm was reversed into
OL,10,Fhim, an inquest has heard.
OL,12,FSecond Lt Max George, 26, of Durham,
OL,13,Fdied at the scene of a training
OL,14,Fexercise on Salisbury Plain, Wiltshire,
OL,15,Fon 21 June 2022.
OL,17,FThe Warrior vehicle had a broken alarm
OL,18,Fsystem, the ongoing inquest at
OL,19,FWiltshire and Swindon Coroner's Court
OL,20,Fpreviously heard.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39902
