OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F399A1793168843
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAArmy to keep learning after
OL,4,Aofficer killed in training - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrig Giles Harry Malec, head of the
OL,7,FArmy Safety Group, apologised to the
OL,8,FGeorge family at the hearing, and said:
OL,9,F"We know that we have to learn from our
OL,10,Fcollective mistakes. We are determined
OL,11,Fto keep learning and do better for our
OL,12,Fpeople, amid the pressures."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
